        "language": "english",
        "review": "A decent roguelike with combat more similar to Nioh than any other soulslikes. Apparently this is a mobile game but there don't seem to be any microtransactions. Combat is okay but a bit too stiff, and the levels are too big for the slow traversal speed unless there's a sprint I'm missing. Moves are random from chests in certain stages but there seems to be a hard cap on how many you can have.\n\nPerformance is a bit off with a lot of random stuttering, even when the device/PC isn't taxed. Stamina feels restrictive at the start but progression seems to be permanent so maybe it improves later. For $3 it's not bad at all, and it's nice that there don't seem to be any MTX.",
